<candidate_text_from_document>4.3 Permitted Disclosures. The Receiving Party may disclose Confidential Information to its employees and advisors who have a need to know, provided such recipients are bound by confidentiality obligations no less protective than those in this Agreement. Nothing in this Section limits the indemnification or liability provisions of Section 9 or Section 10.</candidate_text_from_document>
<output>{"is_duplicate": false, "matched_title": null, "summary": null}</output>
</example_passing_mention_not_duplicate>

